    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mic ma cwako reco",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oluwo gi Musa, ka waco ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luw gi Joisiraili iwaci rijo ni: Ka moro otimo reco ma k'oŋeyo to turo or pa Rwoth moro je, gi timo acel kwoŋ gigipiny ma kiripi timo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jacway ri Were i wi migam m'owir gi mo am'otimo reco, to kelo banja kwoŋ ji, go lamiyo rwath m'ongoye gi ŋolo paka mic ma cwako reco ri Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go lakelo thwon i dhiot ma wema maleŋ ruwaŋ Rwoth, laketho cinge i wic thwon; aka ilathumo thwon ruwaŋ Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam m'owir gi mo lakwanyo remo moro to kelo i Wema ma romo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam lalutho lwet cinge i remo to kiro remo moro dibirio ruwaŋ Rwoth yuwaŋ nanga m'oliero i Kabedo Maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam laketho remo moro i tunge migam ma buban maŋwe kur manitie ruwaŋ Rwoth i Wema ma romo. Aka remo m'odoŋ go lakonjo i tiendi migam ma mic awaŋa, manitie i dhiot ma Wema ma romo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go lawaro woko bor je ma thwon ma mic ma cwako reco; bor je ma umo gigipiny ma iye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "roge ario je kodi bor mere, kodi adec maber loyo ma cuny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "paka ikwanyo wok i thwon ma cowirok ma siem. Jacway ri Were i wi migam lawaŋo i wi migam ma mic awaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To pien thwon kodi riŋo mere, wic mere, olenge, gigipiny ma iye, kodi woyo mere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thwon gibe m'odoŋ, go latiŋo woko kam'olony woko ma kambi, kam'idhur'iye buru, aka ilawaŋo gi yen kam'ikonj'iye buru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka lwak Joisiraili gibe jotimo reco ma jok'ogendera to panere i waŋ jo, to jotimo gimoro acel kwoŋ gigipiny ma or pa Rwoth kwero timo aka jobedi gi banja; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka joniaŋ rumacen reco ma jotimo, kenyo lwak lakelo rwath ri mic ma cwako reco ruwaŋ Wema ma romo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jodongo pa lwak jolaketho cingi jo i wic thwon ruwaŋ Rwoth, aka ilathumo ruwaŋ Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam lakelo remo thwon moro i Wema ma romo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam lalutho lwet cinge i remo to kiro dibirio ruwaŋ Rwoth kodi yuwaŋ nanga m'oliero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go laketho remo moro i tunge migam manitie ruwaŋ Rwoth i Wema ma romo. Aka remo m'odoŋ go lakonjo i tiendi migam ma mic awaŋa manitie i dhiot ma Wema ma romo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go lawaro woko bor mere je to waŋo i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go latimo gi thwon me paka otimo gi thwon ma mic ma cwako reco. Jacway ri Were i wi migam lamiyo mic ma cwako reco pajo, aka ilacwako rijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go latiŋo thwon me gibe to tero woko ma kambi, aka lawaŋo paka thwon marapena; obedo mic ma cwako reco pa lwak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jadhum otimo reco, ma go k'oŋeyo, to timo acel kwoŋ gigipiny ma or pa Rwoth Were pere kwero to bedo jabanja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tekin go niaŋ kwoŋe, go lakelo paka mic pere wod diel m'ongoye gi ŋolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go laketho cinge i wic diel, aka ilathumo kam'ithum'iye mic awaŋa ruwaŋ Rwoth, paka mic ma cwako reco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam lakwanyo remo moro gi lwet cinge to ketho i tunge migam ma mic awaŋa, aka remo m'odoŋ go lakonjo i tiendi migam ma mic awaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bor mere je go lawaŋo i wi migam, paka bor ma cowirok ma siem. Ameno jacway ri Were i wi migam lamiyo mic ma cwako reco pere, aka ilacwako rigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
