              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwan 15:27-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyatoro kwoŋ ji ma lowo me otimo reco ma k'oŋeyo, gi timo acel kwoŋ gigipiny ma or pa Rwoth kwero, to bedo jabanja, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tekin go niaŋ kwoŋe, go lakelo min diel m'ongoye gi ŋolo paka mic, ri reco ma go otimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go laketho cinge i wic mic ma cwako reco, aka ilathumo i kabedo ma mic awaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam lakwanyo remo moro gi lwet cinge to ketho i tunge migam ma mic awaŋa. Aka remo m'odoŋ go lakonjo i tiendi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
